      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The experience of the application of 78 patients after various laparoscopic procedures was generalized. As perioperative anesthesia drug Infulgan (production of corporation \"Jury-Farm\") was applyed. Appointment of Infulgan in standard dose ensured the achievement expressed analgesic effect, reducing the volume of injected opioids and frequency of adverse reactions."},
